  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「ユソウボク」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%A6%E3%82%BD%E3%82%A6%E3%83%9C%E3%82%AF",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 110340713,
      "text": "ユソウボク は、カリブ海の諸島とコロンビア地域沿岸部に分布するハマビシ科ユソウボク属の樹木である。リンネの『植物の種』(1753年) で記載された植物の一つである。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Guaiacum officinale」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guaiacum_officinale",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1376991474,
      "text": "Guaiacum officinale, commonly known as roughbark lignum-vitae, guaiacwood or gaïacwood, is a species of tree in the caltrop family, Zygophyllaceae, that is native to the Caribbean and the northern coast of South America."
    }
